e terms. Complete Restoration Ltd will use the information you provide on this form to be in touch with you and to provide updates and marketing via email. You can change your mind at any time by contacting us at &#039;info@completerestoration.co.uk&#039;. We will treat your information with respect. For more information about our privacy practices please visit the privacy policy page.</span></span></span></span> </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wpcf7-response-output wpcf7-display-none\"></div></form></div>             </div>\n            </div>\n  <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"divtestimonials\"  style=\"background:#6e6e6d url(https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/testimonialbackgroundimage.png);no-repeat;cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:21px;\">\n         <div class=\"inner\">\n            <div id=\"landlords-column-content\" class=\"not-mobile1\">\n             <span id=\"quote-content\"><p>The Complete Restoration Company brings period beauty back to life, making sure each project or item fits perfectly for contemporary or traditional living and design.</p>\n</span>\n             </div>\n            </div>\n  <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n        </div>           \n    </div>\n    </section>    \n<section class=\"target-section target sectcompanies \" id=\"sectcompanies\">\n\t<div  class=\"accredited\">\n        <hr class=\"hrseparatortop\" />\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Proud members of...</h2>\n\t\t<br class=\"tabseparatortop\" />\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"companies\" >\n      <li class=\"licompany\" style=\"display:inline-block;\" >\n           <img class=\"imgcomapny\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/qualified_tile_association_tiler_suffolk.png\" >\n                     </li>   \n      <li class=\"licompany\" style=\"display:inline-block;\" >\n           <img class=\"imgcomapny\" src=\"https://www.completerestoration.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Guild-Emblem-Tr